Package: elomakeR
Title: Flexible Elo Ratings for Arbitrary Sports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Matt", "Waite", email = "matt.waite@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes Elo ratings from a data frame of games for any
    head-to-head sport. Column mapping uses tidy evaluation so games data
    with arbitrary column names can be used directly. Supports a
    settable learning rate (K-factor), home-field advantage, margin-of-
    victory adjustment, tied outcomes, and season-to-season rating
    carryover (continuous, reset, or regressed to the mean). Includes
    helpers to suggest a learning rate and home advantage by grid
    search against historical results, and to extract current
    standings or plot rating trajectories.
